OL,3,GNEWSACity centre balaclava ban to be
OL,4,Aenforced
OL,5,
OL,6,FA ban on face coverings in Nottingham
OL,7,Fcity centre will come into force next
OL,8,Fweek, it has been confirmed.
OL,10,FFrom Tuesday 15 September, police and
OL,11,Fcommunity protection officers will be
OL,12,Fable to ask people to remove coverings
OL,13,Fif they "reasonably believe" they are
OL,14,Fbeing used to conceal their identity to
OL,15,Fcommit crime or anti-social behaviour.
OL,17,FIf people do not co-operate, they could
OL,18,Fbe issued with a #70 on-the-spot fine
OL,19,For face prosecution with a maximum
OL,20,Fpenalty of #1,000.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
